<view class="page" style="padding-bottom: {{pagePad}}px;">
  <view class="card profile">
    <view class="avatar">{{initial}}</view>
    <view class="fields">
      <input class="zh" value="{{profile.shopName}}" bindinput="onShop" />
      <input class="en" value="{{profile.shopNameEn}}" bindinput="onShopEn" />
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="hint">店名会出现在收款弹层上，只保存在这台手机。</view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row" bindtap="restore">恢复演示数据</view>
    <view class="row danger" bindtap="clear">清空码柜</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card copy">
    <view class="h">从演示到真实收款</view>
    <view class="p">1. 在 project.config.json 里换成你的 AppID。</view>
    <view class="p">2. 把 wx.chooseMedia 的临时路径换成云存储或 CDN。</view>
    <view class="p">3. 接统一下单接口，再在收款弹层调用 wx.requestPayment。</view>
    <view class="p">4. 每条码保持 { id, title, channel, action, image, payload, amount }。</view>
  </view>

  <tab-bar active="me" />
</view>
